OL,3,GNEWSAParking wardens hope body cams
OL,4,Awill end abuse and harassment
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom being yelled and beeped at to
OL,7,Fbeing followed on the job, parking
OL,8,Fenforcement officers in Hull say abuse
OL,9,Fhas become their "normal". Now, it is
OL,10,Fhoped body-worn cameras will help
OL,11,Ftackle the problem.
OL,13,FI am walking a regular patrol route in
OL,14,Fthe city with a female civil
OL,15,Fenforcement officer, but I cannot share
OL,16,Fher identity because of concerns for
OL,17,Fher safety.
OL,19,F"I'll get random people trying to ask
OL,20,Fme out, even though I'm telling them to
OL,21,Fmove," she tells me.
